WEBVTT

00:01:33.014 --> 00:01:35.984
Tenchi!

00:01:35.984 --> 00:01:38.214
Ayeka!

00:01:39.121 --> 00:01:42.457
Here, Tenchi... take this.

00:01:42.457 --> 00:01:44.186
What is it, Grandpa?

00:01:44.659 --> 00:01:46.228
Sword Tenchi.

00:01:46.228 --> 00:01:50.999
The magical sword that
transforms Jurai's power into a blade.

00:01:50.999 --> 00:01:52.968
Sword Tenchi?

00:01:52.968 --> 00:01:58.673
Tenchi, you are the only
one who can destroy Kagato.

00:01:58.673 --> 00:02:00.575
Go, Tenchi.

00:02:00.575 --> 00:02:02.509
It is all up to you now.

00:02:07.249 --> 00:02:10.480
Ryoko, you'll be fine.

00:02:44.486 --> 00:02:47.055
Is he going to be all right?
Is he gonna make it?

00:02:47.055 --> 00:02:48.623
I don't know yet.

00:02:48.623 --> 00:02:50.318
Come on, Grandpa.

00:02:51.693 --> 00:02:53.228
Get ahold of yourself.

00:02:53.228 --> 00:02:56.164
We have to pay a visit to
Jurai's royal palace now!

00:02:56.164 --> 00:02:57.399
But, Washu, I can't...

00:02:57.399 --> 00:02:58.333
And listen to me!

00:02:58.333 --> 00:02:59.901
There is no need to be discouraged.

00:02:59.901 --> 00:03:02.304
I'm dying to see Kagato dead.

00:03:02.304 --> 00:03:04.906
And for that, I'm counting on you, Tenchi.

00:03:04.906 --> 00:03:06.474
No, I can't.

00:03:06.474 --> 00:03:09.744
Not even Grandpa was a match for him.

00:03:09.744 --> 00:03:13.248
And, besides, I don't possess this
Jurai power, he was talking about.

00:03:13.248 --> 00:03:16.718
I say you can, Tenchi.
You doubt my judgment?

00:03:16.718 --> 00:03:18.151
Huh?

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:21.356
I could feel it ever since I first saw you.

00:03:21.356 --> 00:03:24.723
I knew you had great potential within you.

00:03:26.161 --> 00:03:31.433
Since you were unaware of
your capability I wasn't 100% sure,

00:03:31.433 --> 00:03:34.769
but now I can see it clearly.

00:03:34.769 --> 00:03:40.139
Tenchi, you do have a force
surpassing that of your grandfather.

00:03:49.784 --> 00:03:52.480
The Jurai... power.

00:04:12.507 --> 00:04:15.877
Huh. It's a whole new game now.

00:04:15.877 --> 00:04:18.471
What are you going to do... Tenchi?

00:04:22.117 --> 00:04:24.813
All of Jurai's military is attacking us.

00:04:28.456 --> 00:04:30.258
All ships ready to attack!

00:04:30.258 --> 00:04:34.896
Your target is the old royal palace of Jurai.

00:04:34.896 --> 00:04:36.887
Fire!

00:05:01.022 --> 00:05:03.582
Hang on. I'm taking us
to the back of the palace.

00:05:29.584 --> 00:05:31.552
It's Ken-Ohki!

00:05:50.405 --> 00:05:52.040
Thanks very much, Nagi.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:54.042
You just saved us.

00:05:54.042 --> 00:05:56.010
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:05:56.010 --> 00:06:00.215
The only reason you're here is because,
I don't want anybody else to take Ryoko's life.

00:06:00.215 --> 00:06:02.274
Oh, I see.

00:06:05.286 --> 00:06:08.056
Hmm. You've got a nice place here.

00:06:08.056 --> 00:06:10.258
We don't have much to offer you,

00:06:10.258 --> 00:06:12.894
but please make yourself
at home, won't you, Nagi?

00:06:12.894 --> 00:06:16.898
Excuse me, but we're kind of in
the middle of something, ya know?

00:06:16.898 --> 00:06:19.567
Well, really, it's no big deal.

00:06:19.567 --> 00:06:22.003
We just have to sneak
into Jurai's royal palace

00:06:22.003 --> 00:06:25.640
and do a little rescuing
of the princess, that's all.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:28.309
Yeah. I see you've got
your hands full, don't you?

00:06:28.309 --> 00:06:30.478
Here.

00:06:30.478 --> 00:06:32.742
Would you like some tea?

00:06:42.624 --> 00:06:43.925
Good.

00:06:43.925 --> 00:06:46.494
Little girl, this tea is excellent.

00:06:46.494 --> 00:06:49.793
Now, you are a professional.
Am I right about that?

00:07:04.078 --> 00:07:07.849
Listen, Tenchi, whatever
happens from now on,

00:07:07.849 --> 00:07:11.876
you stand firm and face your
destiny without fear, but with courage.

00:07:19.661 --> 00:07:22.186
I won't let you down, Grandpa.

00:07:24.966 --> 00:07:27.230
Are you going now, Tenchi?

00:07:28.269 --> 00:07:29.237
Yeah.

00:07:29.237 --> 00:07:31.773
You could die. You know that?

00:07:31.773 --> 00:07:33.570
Possibly.

00:07:35.443 --> 00:07:38.913
Tenchi, you should choose me!

00:07:38.913 --> 00:07:43.952
- Forget Ayeka, can't you?
- Huh?

00:07:43.952 --> 00:07:46.621
You and I could leave right now, Tenchi.

00:07:46.621 --> 00:07:49.357
We'd have no worries, just you and I together.

00:07:49.357 --> 00:07:51.159
Ryoko...

00:07:51.159 --> 00:07:54.762
Sort of like a honeymoon in
deep space, ya know what I mean?

00:07:54.762 --> 00:07:57.253
It would be... fun.

00:07:59.434 --> 00:08:01.102
It sounds fun.

00:08:01.102 --> 00:08:02.899
Huh?

00:08:04.639 --> 00:08:06.174
I'd love to...

00:08:06.174 --> 00:08:08.039
Well, then...

00:08:16.117 --> 00:08:18.953
I'm a space pirate and a powerful one!

00:08:18.953 --> 00:08:21.945
I could just steal you away if I wanted to.

00:08:27.629 --> 00:08:30.097
Oh! Don't go, Tenchi!

00:08:32.433 --> 00:08:35.561
Please... don't, I beg you.

00:08:38.339 --> 00:08:42.410
I can't bear the thought of losing you.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:44.810
Don't go. Don't go.

00:08:53.488 --> 00:08:56.324
But I won't forsake Ayeka. I can't do that.

00:08:56.324 --> 00:08:58.760
Tenchi...

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:02.287
And you see, this is my battle as well now.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.329
Tenchi!

00:09:18.413 --> 00:09:22.611
I can give you a lift. Let me
help you. I know the way there.

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:40.702
What's up?

00:09:40.702 --> 00:09:44.105
So you are going with him, aren't you?

00:09:44.105 --> 00:09:46.908
I'm giving him a ride one way, that's all.

00:09:46.908 --> 00:09:47.875
Is that all?

00:09:47.875 --> 00:09:50.139
What about our fight, Ryoko, huh?

00:09:50.878 --> 00:09:51.846
I haven't forgotten.

00:09:51.846 --> 00:09:54.576
We can get it over with
right now, if you like, Nagi.

00:10:04.025 --> 00:10:06.027
I thought so.

00:10:06.027 --> 00:10:08.329
What do you think you're doing?

00:10:08.329 --> 00:10:11.232
With a serious injury like that, you
may not even make it to the palace.

00:10:11.232 --> 00:10:12.767
Shut up.

00:10:12.767 --> 00:10:15.370
Do you want to fight with me now or not?

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:18.606
I don't take advantage of the wounded.

00:10:18.606 --> 00:10:23.745
If that's your choice, then
I guess I'm going. You just wait here.

00:10:23.745 --> 00:10:25.508
I'll catch you later.

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:31.011
Fool... good luck.

00:10:48.736 --> 00:10:51.172
We'll take care of the main fleet.

00:10:51.172 --> 00:10:53.274
You just concentrate on getting to the palace.

00:10:53.274 --> 00:10:54.809
I got it.

00:10:54.809 --> 00:10:58.179
I really don't know how long we can
keep them busy, Tenchi, but you know that.

00:10:58.179 --> 00:11:00.848
The rest is going to be up to you.

00:11:00.848 --> 00:11:03.251
Tenchi.

00:11:03.251 --> 00:11:05.019
Don't you worry, Sasami.

00:11:05.019 --> 00:11:07.789
I'll bring Ayeka back safely and
everything will be just fine, really.

00:11:07.789 --> 00:11:09.689
I know it will.

00:11:10.324 --> 00:11:15.897
Tenchi, I know your grandpa
has great faith in you, and so do I.

00:11:15.897 --> 00:11:17.732
Dad.

00:11:17.732 --> 00:11:22.637
You know we'll take good
care of Grandpa so you take care.

00:11:22.637 --> 00:11:24.038
Yeah.

00:11:24.038 --> 00:11:26.641
That's enough good-byes. Let's go.

00:11:26.641 --> 00:11:28.199
All right.

00:11:30.044 --> 00:11:31.671
Wish us luck.

00:11:33.314 --> 00:11:35.612
Good luck and have fun, okay, Tenchi?

00:11:48.629 --> 00:11:52.967
Okay. I think you better go
before things get a little too nasty.

00:11:52.967 --> 00:11:55.136
I was just leaving.

00:11:55.136 --> 00:11:56.467
Hmm.

00:12:08.583 --> 00:12:11.108
Hmm. Yeah, I know.

00:12:56.764 --> 00:12:58.288
Tenchi.

00:13:01.936 --> 00:13:03.437
A message from the front line:

00:13:03.437 --> 00:13:06.240
They've just spotted Ryo-Ohki
around the fourth defensive line.

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:08.640
Transfer fleet to that site immediately.

00:13:16.217 --> 00:13:19.220
We've chased Ryo-Ohki
to the seventh satellite area.

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:21.848
They will intercept Ryo-Ohki in two minutes.

00:13:37.772 --> 00:13:39.674
What? What?!

00:13:39.674 --> 00:13:40.708
What is it?

00:13:40.708 --> 00:13:43.344
It looks like there are two Ryo-Ohkis.

00:13:43.344 --> 00:13:45.175
What? Impossible!

00:13:55.656 --> 00:14:00.150
No. The first ship wasn't
Ryo-Ohki. It was its shadow.

00:14:00.528 --> 00:14:02.393
Clever.

00:14:05.366 --> 00:14:07.501
Looks like they fell for our trick.

00:14:07.501 --> 00:14:09.737
We all have our own parts to play.

00:14:09.737 --> 00:14:10.671
Right.

00:14:10.671 --> 00:14:13.541
Well, thank goodness
that Nagi decided to help us.

00:14:13.541 --> 00:14:14.838
Mm-hmm.

00:14:15.476 --> 00:14:17.569
Now! Engines fire!

00:14:22.049 --> 00:14:24.313
Now let's go, Ken-Ohki.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:28.185
Come back alive, Ryoko.

00:14:57.885 --> 00:14:59.546
Hey, Ryoko!

00:15:34.789 --> 00:15:36.552
Ryoko?

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:42.163
Sorry for the delay.

00:15:42.163 --> 00:15:44.461
Well, let's go.

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:09.284
Get out of my way!

00:16:21.102 --> 00:16:22.569
Ryoko!

00:16:24.905 --> 00:16:27.308
Oh, Tenchi, don't you worry about anything.

00:16:27.308 --> 00:16:32.245
I swear I will make sure
you get to Jurai's royal palace.

00:16:41.756 --> 00:16:43.424
Don't be a chicken, Ryo-Ohki.

00:16:43.424 --> 00:16:46.416
We're not cowards.
Let's show them what we can do!

00:17:11.252 --> 00:17:13.516
Go!

00:17:29.503 --> 00:17:31.334
Oh. That's it.

00:17:59.133 --> 00:18:01.067
So... we're here.

00:18:02.803 --> 00:18:04.737
They're here.

00:18:16.851 --> 00:18:19.513
From this point, you're on your own, Tenchi.

00:18:21.088 --> 00:18:25.159
I hope you know I wasn't planning on
helping you rescue that other woman.

00:18:25.159 --> 00:18:27.093
After all, I am a pirate.

00:18:28.863 --> 00:18:30.990
Thank you, Ryoko.

00:18:35.669 --> 00:18:38.604
You ain't got all day,
you know! You're wasting time!

00:18:48.349 --> 00:18:49.950
We thank you for the escort.

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:53.721
Not even 1,000 knights
could match your spirit, Ryoko.

00:18:53.721 --> 00:18:55.518
- Good-bye.
- Good-bye.

00:19:12.173 --> 00:19:13.936
Tenchi...

00:19:51.312 --> 00:19:57.808
Well, Ryo-Ohki, it seems like it's
just you and me again, all alone.

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:05.092
Mmm. It's been fun, though.

00:20:05.092 --> 00:20:08.118
We've had a blast since we
fell on the Earth, haven't we?

00:20:15.736 --> 00:20:17.905
I'm lonely.

00:20:17.905 --> 00:20:20.032
I sound silly, don't I?

00:20:45.532 --> 00:20:50.401
So where shall we go next?
What do you think, Ryo-Ohki?

00:22:52.192 --> 00:22:55.796
Come if you may, you
young crown prince of Jurai.

00:22:55.796 --> 00:22:59.400
Come to me and shed your blood of defeat.

00:22:59.400 --> 00:23:03.604
Yosho and Kagato delight in the
darkness that divides the universe.

00:23:03.604 --> 00:23:06.907
Now that you have the power
to overcome the light, Kagato,

00:23:06.907 --> 00:23:09.209
what plan do you have in mind?

00:23:09.209 --> 00:23:11.278
I don't know anything.

00:23:11.278 --> 00:23:13.180
But one thing I know for sure

00:23:13.180 --> 00:23:14.948
is that I will take Ayeka back
from you whatever the cost.

00:23:14.948 --> 00:23:17.184
Next episode is: "No Need for a Showdown!"

00:23:17.184 --> 00:23:20.085
It's unquestionably a great showdown!
